# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# The project was authored on Windows, so the tree arrived mixed: 37 files with
# CRLF and 151 with LF. Editing a CRLF file from a Unix tool rewrites every
# line, which buries a ten-line change in a thousand-line diff. Storing LF and
# letting Git convert on checkout keeps diffs honest on both platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF or cmd.exe mis-parses them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.tgs binary
*.lottie binary
*.pdf binary
